{
  "priorities": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "ANIMATION LAYER",
      "color": "#FF9900",
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "SA1.1",
          "title": "Clock & timing infrastructure",
          "status": "DONE",
          "summary": "src/map.js: added THREE.Clock in initMap plus module-scope animation registries (pulseObjects, capitalOrbiters, twinkleObjects). animate() now captures delta via a single clock.getDelta() per frame and reads t from clock.elapsedTime (getElapsedTime() would double-advance the clock in r128). No scene.traverse used."
        },
        {
          "id": "SA1.2",
          "title": "Cloud core pulse",
          "status": "DONE",
          "summary": "src/map.js buildFactionClouds(): core Points layers tagged userData {animType:'cloudCore', baseOpacity:0.22, amplitude:0.05, phase:(hashString(key)%628)/100}. initMap registers all tagged cloud layers into pulseObjects; new updateAmbient(t) in animate sets opacity = base + amp*sin(t*0.35 + phase). Faction cores now breathe on an ~18s cycle."
        },
        {
          "id": "SA1.3",
          "title": "Cloud halo + ring pulse",
          "status": "DONE",
          "summary": "src/map.js buildFactionClouds(): halo layers tagged baseOpacity 0.07 / amplitude 0.02, ring layers baseOpacity 0.35 / amplitude 0.08 with phase offset +2.0 rad vs core. All three cloud layers now pulse via the shared updateAmbient(t) loop at slightly different phases."
        },
        {
          "id": "SA1.4",
          "title": "Capital orbiter particles",
          "status": "DONE",
          "summary": "src/map.js: new buildCapitalOrbiters(scene, systems, factions, THREE, registerFactionObj) creates a SphereGeometry(0.045,6,6) faction-coloured satellite per capital with seeded radius 0.32 / speed 0.25-0.45 / random phase. Positions updated in updateAmbient(): XZ circular orbit + 0.05 Y bob at 2x speed. Orbiters registered per faction so the filter hides them with their faction."
        },
        {
          "id": "SA1.5",
          "title": "Idle camera drift",
          "status": "DONE",
          "summary": "src/map.js: replaced OrbitControls autoRotate with tickIdleDrift(delta). pointerdown/wheel (and programmatic zoom/fly-to via bumpAutoRotate) reset lastInteraction; after 6000ms idle the camera rotates about the target Y axis at 0.06 rad/s (~105s per revolution), preserving current zoom radius and elevation. Drift is suppressed during fly-to tweens. Removed now-unused AUTOROTATE_RESUME_MS."
        },
